  "description": "The proposed development comprises the construction of an additional storey above the existing building under permitted development rights (Schedule 2, Part 20, Class AA of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015, as amended).\n\nThe development involves the removal of the existing mansard roof structure and its replacement with a new lightweight additional storey to provide 5 self-contained residential units.\n\nThe proposal retains the existing building footprint and structural arrangement. The additional storey has been designed to integrate with the existing building form and appearance through the use of sympathetic materials and architectural detailing.\n\n\n\nAssociated works include installation of new windows and external materials, internal residential layouts, and the provision of refuse, recycling and cycle storage facilities required to support the new dwellings. Access to the building will continue to be provided through the existing entrance and circulation core. All works will comply with relevant Building Regulations including fire safety, structural stability and means of escape.",
